  "scguardgolem.manual.title": "Security Guard Golem",
  "scguardgolem.manual.help": "Convert a vanilla Iron Golem into an owned guard by right-clicking it with any SecurityCraft Keycard. The keycard is consumed and you become the owner.\n\nRight-click your golem with SecurityCraft Wire Cutters to open its config screen: install modules (Harming, Speed, Smart, Storage) and SecurityCraft Allowlist/Denylist modules, toggle patrol and threat mode, and lay out a patrol route.\n\nWhile holding Wire Cutters, crouch twice within 1.5 seconds to drop a route waypoint at your feet. Right-click a Bell within 64 blocks to recall your golems to their first waypoint.\n\nBare-hand right-click opens the passcode-protected loot; crouch + bare-hand as the owner to set the passcode. The golem responds to EMP like other SecurityCraft devices — reactivate a shut-down golem with redstone.",

